SUMMARY:Jason: Philadelphia\, PA
DESCRIPTION:Philadelphia Catholic Collaborators / Becket Fund meeting and G
 ala / Ward Fitzgerald event hold\n\nStatus: Booked\nOverview: Melissa is jo
 ining\; Philadelphia trip runs Wednesday Jun 10 through Saturday Jun 13.\nH
 otel: Canopy by Hilton Philadelphia Center City\, 1180 Ludlow Street\, Phil
 adelphia\, PA 19107. Check-in starts 4:00 PM Wednesday\; checkout is by 12:
 00 PM Saturday. Phone: +1 215-258-9400. Hilton page: https://www.hilton.com
 /en/hotels/phloppy-canopy-philadelphia-center-city/.\nWed Jun 10: Jason fli
 es FWA-ORD-PHL early and is scheduled to arrive PHL at 9:40 AM. Hotel check
 -in starts at 4:00 PM. Melissa's outbound is still unconfirmed in Jason iCl
 oud\, but the working option arrives PHL around 4:50/4:53 PM for the 6:00 P
 M Barnes event.\nThu Jun 11: Philadelphia Catholic Collaborators / Becket F
 und schedule details still need final confirmation.\nFri Jun 12: Gala / War
 d Fitzgerald event hold remains on the trip plan\; final time and venue det
 ails still need confirmation.\nSat Jun 13: Jason returns PHL-CLT-FWA\, depa
 rting PHL at 12:07 PM and arriving FWA at 5:14 PM. Hotel checkout is availa
 ble until noon\, but the flight timing means airport departure will need to
  be earlier.\nPacking/logistics: Melissa should plan carry-on only because
  the Wednesday transfer is tight. Jason plans to check bags.\nJason flight
  confirmation found in personal iCloud: American confirmation is on file wi
 th Clive\; do not publish booking/payment details publicly.\nJason booked o
 utbound: Wed Jun 10 AA6208 FWA-ORD 5:25 AM-5:35 AM\, seat 7B\; AA2115 ORD-P
 HL 6:29 AM-9:40 AM\, seat 13A.\nJason booked return: Sat Jun 13 AA1311 PHL-
 CLT 12:07 PM-2:00 PM\; AA6078 CLT-FWA 3:19 PM-5:14 PM\, seat 8B. This repla
 ces the earlier assumed 10:30 AM PHL-CLT option.\n\nView live: https://jstr
 avelschedule.netlify.app
LOCATION:Philadelphia\, PA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
