 ill\; St. Anthony Shrine\, 100 Arch St\, is best for downtown/lunch-hour Ma
 ss and confession\; Our Lady of Good Voyage\, 51 Seaport Blvd\, is useful i
 f ending near Seaport/harbor. Old North Church is on the trail but Episcopa
 l\, not Catholic.\n\nView live: https://jstravelschedule.netlify.app
